Hibernate (Older than Spring Data JPA)
- Hibernate is an ORM (Object-Relational Mapping) framework.
- ORM Talks to DB in simpler manner.
- It maps Java classes (entities) to DB tables and Java objects to rows.
- Instead of writing raw SQL, you write HQL (Hibernate Query Language) or use methods, and Hibernate generates SQL under the hood.

